window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A love so strong...</b></p> <p>Darkness abounds once again as Mori clings to her sanity with desperate fingers. Kai, Walker, Levi, and Remi are mindless with desperation to have her back. Moira wrestles with the opportunity to right a wrong committed on her behalf, even if it means sacrificing herself. Can they work together to return their lives to the way they once were?</p> <p><b>...not even darkness can hinder its power.</b></p> <p>Black Cat Security has risen once again, and now they all must come together as a familiar foe pulls strings in the background, orchestrating magekynd to his tune. Mages are still missing but have never been forgotten. A person close to Mori's heart has disappeared. Amongst all of this chaos, magekynd has its first serial killer. The question is, can they put a stop to it all before it's too late and Mori loses someone close to her?</p> <p>Will Mori ever find peace in her happily ever after?</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
